cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Framefetch in research or publications, please cite it as below."
title: "Framefetch (帧取): self-hosted video downloader and AI video / screenplay analysis"
abstract: >-
  Framefetch is an open-source, self-hosted workflow for authorized video
  downloading, local MP4 import, screenplay processing and AI video analysis
  with Markdown and DOCX reports, built on FastAPI, Next.js, PostgreSQL,
  Temporal, RabbitMQ and MinIO.
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-10-20"
authors:
  - alias: StephenQiu30
repository-code: "https://github.com/StephenQiu30/framefetch"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - self-hosted
  - video-analysis
  - screenplay-analysis
  - media-processing
  - fastapi
  - nextjs
  - video-downloader
  - llm
  - shot-analysis
  - ffmpeg
  - yt-dlp
